    "body": "@annevk I'm not familiar with that. Since WebLocks are per-origin, I don't see how it leaks information cross-origin (which is Chrome Security's concern).\r\n\r\nAs for emulation, yes, I believe this [demo](https://message-port-weakref-forced-gc-learning.glitch.me/) demonstrates that this information is already pretty readily available. However, the concern was about explictly baking it in. I would argue that the difference is slight but then maybe that's why I'm not on the security team...",
