    "updated_at": "2024-03-18T04:43:04Z",
    "body": "It should be possible to provide a service over `MessagePort`, across domains, with a decent chance of avoid leaks. So it should be possible opt-in to sending close on document destruction. I've seens suggestions that just using the port or adding a listener to it is enough of a signal or it come be more explicit like `port.closeOnDestroy = true`.\r\n",
